# Keyboard only: Tab order and focus on the wizard's pages. Fresh scratch home, one stand-in
# install. `key Tab` moves focus the way a person's Tab does; `expect focus` reads which
# control has it (the control a screen reader would announce).

mkinstall ${HOME}/Games/Dragon Age Origins
run 300

# Welcome: the page's controls in reading order, nothing before them
expect page Welcome
key Tab
expect focus Search this computer
key Tab
expect focus Pick the game's folder
key Tab
expect focus Don't have the game
key Shift+Tab
expect focus Pick the game's folder
key Shift+Tab
expect focus Search this computer

# Enter on a focused button presses it; focus follows the page
key Enter
wait
expect page Search
expect heading Found 1 install
# focus goes to the results when the search ends
expect focus Keep
key Tab
expect focus Pick a folder
key Tab
expect focus Search again
key Tab
expect focus Back
key Tab
expect focus Continue

# Continue by keyboard lands on the keys page with focus inside it
key Enter
run 300
expect page Keys
expect heading Downloadable content
expect focus Choose a keys file
key Tab
expect focus Back
key Tab
expect focus Finish
key Enter
run 300
expect page Play
expect focus Dragon Age

# The tabs sit before the page, in reading order Play, Games, Mods, Settings
key Shift+Tab
expect focus Settings
key Shift+Tab
expect focus Mods
key Shift+Tab
expect focus Games
key Shift+Tab
expect focus Play
key Tab
expect focus Games
key Enter
run 300
expect page Games
quit
